<title>JAPAN: Hungary mulls launching samurai bonds -- sources.</title>
<headline>Hungary mulls launching samurai bonds -- sources.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary is considering launching about 50 billion yen worth of samurai bonds as early as Wednesday, underwriting sources said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>They said the duration of the issue could be seven years, with one of the four major Japanese brokerage houses expected to lead-manage the issue.</p>
